[{"_1":2},"llms/mdx",{"_3":4},"data","# Deploy Lamassu (/docs/deployment/overview)\n\n\n\nYou can run Lamassu on your own Kubernetes cluster, deploy a prebuilt image from AWS Marketplace or consume the platform as a managed service.\n\nChoose a model [#choose-a-model]\n\n| Model                   | Recommended for                                            | Who operates the infrastructure | Starting point             |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Kubernetes self-managed | Production, regulated environments and custom deployments  | Your team                       | Helm or Fastlane           |\n| AWS Marketplace         | Evaluation or a dedicated deployment inside an AWS account | Your team                       | Preconfigured image on EC2 |\n| SaaS                    | Teams that want to use the platform without operating it   | Lamassu                         | Managed subscription       |\n\n<Cards>\n  <Card title=\"Kubernetes self-managed\" description=\"Control network, storage, keys, dependencies and the upgrade cycle.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview\" />\n\n  <Card title=\"AWS Marketplace\" description=\"Launch a preconfigured Lamassu instance on AWS EC2.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/aws-marketplace\" />\n\n  <Card title=\"Lamassu SaaS\" description=\"Use an operated and updated instance as a managed service.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/saas\" />\n</Cards>\n\nJust want to evaluate the platform? [#just-want-to-evaluate-the-platform]\n\nUse [Fastlane](/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane) to bring up PostgreSQL, Keycloak, RabbitMQ and Lamassu on a Kubernetes cluster through a single flow. It is intended for labs, demos and bootstrap; for production, configure dependencies and Helm values explicitly.\n\nAfter deployment [#after-deployment]\n\nOnce the console is available, continue with [Create your first CA](/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority). That quickstart verifies the cryptographic engine and issuance work correctly.\n"]
